claim_principal: pi-agent
author: claude
estimated_minutes: 900
acceptance_criteria: "The environment specification pins the repository commit, the gate command set and the verdict extraction, and is content-addressed like every other environment; a recorded episode stores a content-addressed identity for the candidate tree, not only the base commit, and replay resolves that exact artifact; a replayed episode produces the same verdict; each sandbox episode carries a stable link to its corresponding pull request; the sim-to-real gap is computed over the paired cohort present on both sides with the denominator stated, and unpaired candidates are reported separately as coverage rather than folded into a rate; no episode captures repository credentials or hosted service data"
